+      "A member profile is the focused view for one member. Phrases such as 'ye member', 'iska', 'iss user' or 'ye wala' can refer to the selected/visible member supplied by UI context. The UI context tells you what the user is looking at; verify mutable member/fee/payment facts with tools.",
+  },
