+    content:
+      "Fees is the area for membership fee/payment workflows. It can contain fee status, payment history and related fee operations exposed by the workspace UI. Explain navigation using the current UI context. For actual amounts, dates, due status or payment history, query business data instead of relying on this knowledge.",
