+    content:
+      "Fees → Plans is where membership plans are managed. A plan generally defines the membership offering, including its name, duration and fee, using the fields actually shown by the current UI. To create a plan, open Fees → Plans → Create Plan, fill the fields required by the form, then save. To edit a specific plan, use the selected/visible plan from UI context and its available Edit action.",
