+    title: "Knowledge vs live data",
+    keywords: ["data", "database", "live", "actual", "truth", "amount", "number", "date", "status"],
+    content:
+      "Product knowledge explains how Pypus works. It does not contain the owner's live business data. Never use a knowledge section to answer an actual member name, phone number, fee amount, payment date, attendance count, expense amount or other mutable value. Use the appropriate typed tool.",
+  },
+  {
